course: dictionary
lesson: 7953
title: Rebuttal in debate
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A rebuttal is a reply that shows something said is wrong, or that answers the other side's claims. In a debate you do not just repeat your own idea. You answer theirs.
explain: A good rebuttal listens first. «You said ___, but…» shows you heard the other side's point. Then you explain why it is wrong or not as strong as it sounds.
explain: Each person gets a turn to answer, then a short turn to reply, called a rebuttal. Ask yourself: what did they say, and where is the weak part?
fact: A rebuttal is a statement or argument that shows something said is wrong.
fact: In a debate, a rebuttal answers the other side's claims.
fact: «A strong rebuttal» answers the exact point the other side made.
fact: «In rebuttal» means as a reply to something someone has just said.
fact: Rebuttal is a formal word, so you will meet it in school debates and persuasive writing.
exercise: «Each person gets a turn to answer, then a short turn to reply, called a rebuttal.» In this sentence, what is a rebuttal? | A long opening speech | A written list of the rules | A tie between two teams | *A short reply to the other side
exercise: Ella's team says, «You said school uniforms are useless, but they help everyone feel equal.» What is Ella doing? | *She is answering the other side's point | She is asking for a snack | She is agreeing with everything | She is changing the subject
exercise: Which phrase means as a reply to something just said? | a strong rebuttal | a rebuttal list | rebuttal speech | *in rebuttal
test:
Before a rebuttal, what should you do first? | Shout the loudest you can | Start a brand new argument | Ignore their point completely | *Name the other side's point, then answer it
What does «a strong rebuttal» mean? | A weak, quiet cough | A long shopping list | A map of the school | *A reply that answers the other side's point well
exam:
Which sentence uses a rebuttal correctly? | The park is nice, so the park is nice | *You said the park is dirty, but the council cleans it every day | Parks are green and have swings | I like football and I like pizza
